WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:07.034
Meet Minova Chromium. A focused Windows browser, built around the way you actually browse.

00:06.734 --> 00:17.192
On first launch, choose the interface that fits you. Use Workspace UI for deep organization, or Classic UI for a familiar horizontal tab bar.

00:16.892 --> 00:27.350
Workspace UI keeps tabs inside color-coded contexts, so personal browsing, work, gaming, and anything you create stay neatly separated.

00:27.050 --> 00:35.708
Need more room? Collapse the sidebar into a compact rail, then bring every workspace and tab back with one click.

00:35.408 --> 00:43.346
Split View places two live Chromium pages side by side, without opening another window or losing either tab.

00:43.046 --> 00:50.936
Prefer the traditional browser layout? Switch to Classic UI at any time, while keeping every Minova feature.

00:50.636 --> 00:59.054
Make Minova yours with full theme control, from the background and toolbar to text, borders, accents, and warnings.

00:58.754 --> 01:09.644
Install compatible Chrome extensions, pin their actions, and reach history, bookmarks, downloads, updates, and tools from the refined quick menu.

01:09.344 --> 01:18.410
Minova can import Google Password Manager exports into a Windows-encrypted local vault and offer matching logins only on the right site.

01:18.110 --> 01:27.488
Boost quiet browser audio, open supported video in an always-on-top player, and keep media controls close without interrupting your workflow.

01:27.188 --> 01:34.742
For supported services, Streaming Mode adds a protected playback surface beneath Minova's own browser controls.

01:34.442 --> 01:41.492
Fast. Personal. Built for focus. Minova Chromium. Browse your way.
